    univ isOpen_univ (mem_univ _) ((),true) (by rfl)
  dsimp only at hfan
  obtain ⟨F,hpF,hFzero,_,hFmarks,r,hr,hrhalf,v,hvn,hvzero,hvop,hvaxis,hvdisj,hgerms,
